// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Linter
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/// The core lint engine. Performs a single-pass, depth-first traversal of the
/// tree-sitter syntax tree and dispatches nodes to matching rules.
///
/// # Performance
///
